---
layout: none
sitemap: false
excerpt_separator: ""
---
[
{%- comment -%}
  全ページの見出し（ページの冒頭 + h2・h3）ごとに 1 項目を並べる。
  index の項目にするのは h2・h3 だけだが、重なり順（headingSeq）を数えるのは h4 も含む
  （識別子は本文側の JS が見出しの文言と重なり順から作るため、ここでは作らない）。
  他ページの content を列挙順より前に読むと Markdown のまま返るため、
  常に markdownify してから読む。
  1 項目の本文の長さ 200 は本文側の JS の SEARCH_CONTENT_MAX と揃える。
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign pages = site.html_pages | where_exp: "p", "p.url != '/search.json'" -%}
{%- assign first_entry = true -%}
{%- for page in pages -%}
  {%- assign title = page.title | default: page.name -%}
  {%- assign url = page.url | relative_url -%}
  {%- assign source = page.content -%}
  {%- assign source = source | markdownify -%}
  {%- assign marked = source | replace: "<h2", "§H§<h2" | replace: "<h3", "§H§<h3" | replace: "<h4", "§H§<h4" -%}
  {%- assign chunks = marked | split: "§H§" -%}

  {%- assign intro = chunks[0] | strip_html | replace: "　", " " | strip_newlines | strip | truncate: 200 -%}
  {%- unless first_entry -%},{%- endunless -%}
  {"title": {{ title | jsonify }}, "url": {{ url | jsonify }}, "path": {{ page.path | jsonify }}, "heading": {{ title | jsonify }}, "headingSeq": 0, "content": {{ intro | jsonify }}}
  {%- assign first_entry = false -%}

  {%- assign seen_headings = "" | split: "," -%}
  {%- for chunk in chunks offset: 1 -%}
    {%- assign level = chunk | slice: 0, 3 -%}
    {%- assign tag_open = chunk | split: ">" | first -%}
    {%- assign after_open = chunk | remove_first: tag_open | remove_first: ">" -%}
    {%- assign close_tag = "</h2>" -%}
    {%- if level == "<h3" -%}{%- assign close_tag = "</h3>" -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if level == "<h4" -%}{%- assign close_tag = "</h4>" -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- assign head_split = after_open | split: close_tag -%}
    {%- assign heading_text = head_split[0] | strip_html | strip -%}
    {%- assign body_html = head_split | slice: 1, 999 | join: close_tag -%}

    {%- assign seen_headings = seen_headings | push: heading_text -%}
    {%- assign heading_seq = seen_headings | where_exp: "t", "t == heading_text" | size -%}

    {%- if level == "<h2" or level == "<h3" -%}
      {%- assign body = body_html | strip_html | replace: "　", " " | strip_newlines | strip | truncate: 200 -%}
,
      {"title": {{ title | jsonify }}, "url": {{ url | jsonify }}, "path": {{ page.path | jsonify }}, "heading": {{ heading_text | jsonify }}, "headingSeq": {{ heading_seq }}, "content": {{ body | jsonify }}}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
]
